"text":"太平二年，拜骠骑将军。","evidence":["zhulv-q2-03b673d9d4d9d7a28b88"]},{"id":"zhulv-f2-a91a9dd4e10e80246381","text":"永安初，迁上大将军、都护，督自巴丘上迄西陵；元兴元年，就拜左大司马。","evidence":["zhulv-q-331c0fcf3c1964c0744f"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"shaodi-m-o181-shaodi-p0155","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["shaodi-q-o181"]},{"id":"luxun-m-o064-shaodi-p0155","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["luxun-q-o064"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"huangli-q-1c19a53fc2fdfca557a9","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-ffc116c405cea888a171","layer":"original","quote":"吴太傅诸葛恪以初破魏军，大兴兵众以图攻取","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-e-o064b-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-e457a4bbaedb13718e38","layer":"original","quote":"建衡二年，大司马施绩卒〖18〗；拜抗都督信陵、西陵、夷道、乐乡、公安诸军事〖19〗，治乐乡。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":288,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":17,"end":63,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-o064","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-e457a4bbaedb13718e38","layer":"original","quote":"孙皓即位，加镇军大将军，领益州牧。建衡二年，大司马施绩卒〖18〗；拜抗都督信陵、西陵、夷道、乐乡、公安诸军事〖19〗，治乐乡。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":288,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":63,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-19571f6808ce1989d96e","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-e798b0310c16e3738a9e","layer":"original","quote":"元兴元年八月，以上大将军施绩、大将军丁奉，为左、右大司马；张布为骠骑将军，加侍中；诸增位班赏，一皆如旧","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":309,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-296f551772590b86078d","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-f8f66aaddf4db29220ba","layer":"original","quote":"将军留平，别诣施绩于南郡〖5〗，议兵所向","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":269,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":54,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-558ba95dc314ce0aae97","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-4a94fbfb17c35295d445","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，左大司马施绩卒","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":397,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":11,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o047d-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-3b3163edc9e235a7bd49","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，以特进孙资为骠骑将军。十一月，司空孙礼薨。十二月，甲辰〖15〗，东海王霖薨。乙未〖16〗，征南将军王昶渡江〖17〗，掩攻吴，破之。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":184,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":69,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o055b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-2d3651c906b3924f6677","layer":"original","quote":"五年夏四月〖1〗，大赦。五月，吴太傅诸葛恪围合肥新城；诏太尉司马孚拒之。﹝一﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":239,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-aa6ace448e938821edac","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-aa6ace448e938821edac","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗五年：嘉平五年（公元 253）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":244,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4e568bedcd1f34c38680","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o055","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-2d3651c906b3924f6677","layer":"original","quote":"五年夏四月〖1〗，大赦。五月，吴太傅诸葛恪围合肥新城；诏太尉司马孚拒之。﹝一﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":239,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o181","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ea286b92a8b1777eb5cd","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，丁亥〖1〗，诏曰：“昔圣帝明王，静乱济世，‘保大定功’〖2〗；文武殊途，勋烈同归〖3〗。是故或舞干戚以训不庭〖4〗；或陈师旅以威暴慢〖5〗。至于爱民全国〖6〗，康惠庶类〖7〗；必先修文教，示之轨仪；不得已然后用兵：此盛德之所同也。往者季汉分崩〖8〗，九土颠覆〖9〗；刘备、孙权，乘间作祸。三祖绥宁中夏〖10〗，日不暇给；遂使遗寇，僭逆历世〖11〗。幸赖宗庙威灵，宰辅忠武；爰发四方，拓定庸、蜀〖12〗；役不浃时〖13〗，一征而克。自顷江表衰弊，政刑荒暗；巴、汉平定〖14〗，孤危无援；交、荆、扬、越〖15〗，靡然向风。今交阯伪将吕兴，已帅三郡，万里归命；武陵邑侯相严等纠合五县〖16〗，请为臣妾；豫章、庐陵山民举众叛吴〖17〗，以‘助北将军’为号；又孙休病死，主帅改易〖18〗，国内乖违，人各有心；伪将施绩〖19〗，贼之名臣，怀疑自猜，深见忌恶：众叛亲离，莫有固志。自古及今，未有亡征若此之甚。若六军震曜，南临江、汉，吴、会之域必扶老携幼以迎王师〖20〗，必然之理也。然兴动大众，犹有劳费；宜告喻威德，开示仁信，使知顺附和同之利。相国参军事徐绍、水曹掾孙彧〖21〗，昔在寿春，并见虏获。绍本伪南陵督〖22〗，才质开壮〖23〗；彧，孙权支属，忠良见事〖24〗。其遣绍南还，以彧为副；宣扬国命，告喻吴人。诸所示语，皆以事实。若其觉悟，不损征伐之计；盖庙胜长算〖25〗，自古之道也。其以绍兼散骑常侍，加奉车都尉，封都亭侯；彧兼给事黄门侍郎，赐爵关内侯。绍等所赐妾及男女家人在此者，悉听自随，以明国恩；不必使还，以开广大信。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":298,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":663,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0016","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-7bd943dc7147c2f75ba7","layer":"original","quote":"转为镇南将军。诸葛诞战于东关，不利；乃令诞、俭对换。诞为镇南，都督豫州。俭为镇东，都督扬州。吴太傅诸葛恪围合肥新城，俭与文钦御之；太尉司马孚督中军东，解围，恪退还。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0041","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-0c032a6da7eae7e225ce","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛恪围合肥新城，不克，退归。艾言景王曰：“孙权已没，大臣未附；吴名宗大族，皆有部曲〖20〗；阻兵仗势，足以（建）〔违〕命。恪新秉国政，而内无其主；不念抚恤上下以立根基，竞于外事〖21〗，虐用其民；悉国之众，顿于坚城，死者万数，载祸而归。此恪获罪之日也。昔子胥、吴起、商鞅、乐毅皆见任时君〖22〗，主没而败。况恪才非四贤，而不虑不患，其亡可待也。”恪归，果见诛。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":267,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":181,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0221","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-7bd943dc7147c2f75ba7","layer":"original","quote":"吴太傅诸葛恪围合肥新城，俭与文钦御之；太尉司马孚督中军东，解围，恪退还","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":46,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0340","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-0c032a6da7eae7e225ce","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛恪围合肥新城，不克，退归","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":267,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xuhuwang-q-31aed6ec65e1285c8549","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-d91e3ae6a09aaa15b47e","layer":"original","quote":"二年〖22〗，昶奏：“孙权流放良臣〖23〗，嫡庶分争〖24〗；可乘衅而制吴、蜀。白帝、夷陵之间〖25〗，黔、巫、秭归、房陵皆在江北〖26〗；民、夷与新城郡接〖27〗：可袭取也。”","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":207,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xuhuwang-q-3b1df409edd7aa611aca","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-4bc0503677ef81b58449","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛诞反，昶据夹石以逼江陵〖34〗，持施绩、全熙，使不得东〖35〗。","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":211,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xuhuwang-q-5aa3589fbf970a3d1a71","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-9aa66ef038f5e52e2dec","layer":"original","quote":"昶欲引致平地与合战，乃先遣五军案大道发还〖32〗，使贼望见以喜之；以所获铠马甲首〖33〗，驰环城以怒之；设伏兵以待之。绩果追军；与战，克之，绩遁走，斩其将钟离茂、许旻，收其甲首旗鼓珍宝器仗，振旅而还。王基、州泰皆有功。","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":209,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":109,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xuhuwang-q-d5429e748b6b56be9570","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-2eee00b1e96c9cb1b922","layer":"original","quote":"乃遣新城太守州泰袭巫、秭归、房陵〖28〗，荆州刺史王基诣夷陵；昶诣江陵，两岸引竹f为桥〖29〗，渡水击之〖30〗。贼奔南岸，凿七道并来攻。于是昶使积弩同时俱发，贼大将施绩夜遁入江陵城〖31〗，追斩数百级。","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":102,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-8b9e70c5556972f45fd9","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-33dcd8c4dccefbc86e0b","layer":"original","quote":"恪既诛，遣无难督施宽，就将军施绩、孙壹、全熙等，取融。融猝闻兵士至，惶惧犹豫，不能决计；兵到围城，饮药而死。三子，皆伏诛","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":316,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-03259ab1604a1fdbe066","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-07b20463f19d9ca2a1a8","layer":"original","quote":"绩以五凤中〖22〗，表还为施氏","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":123,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":37,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-05fcc5a99f3be1ae7882","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-2644798b5c13bf211507","layer":"original","quote":"二年春〖14〗，恪向新城，要绩并力〖15〗；而留置半州，使融兼其任","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":11,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-1b30ec536f7ce581b559","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-d611d5b9e32237bf8be4","layer":"original","quote":"随太常潘濬讨五溪，复有功","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":32,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-21259ce148f7c00dd50b","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-f23800be07859b108789","layer":"original","quote":"孙2 秉政，大臣疑贰〖16〗。绩恐吴必扰乱，而中国乘衅〖17〗；乃密书结蜀，使为并兼之虑","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":121,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":11,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-28a47a1f106a8b7b801a","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-6da951f01660a7939664","layer":"pei","quote":"异又随诸葛恪围新城，城既不拔；异等皆言宜速还豫章，袭石头城，不过数日可拔","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":295,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c647a7a3182c67039e5c","start":10,"end":46,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-2fa86e07083ac4e62f2a","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-c9cf0497c6ffd682f91e","layer":"original","quote":"绩便引兵及昶于纪南〖12〗。纪南去城三十里，绩先战胜而融不进，绩后失利","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":131,"end":166,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-331c0fcf3c1964c0744f","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-7e39d2703b1611823207","layer":"original","quote":"永安初，迁上大将军，都护，督自巴丘上迄西陵。元兴元年，就拜左大司马〖20〗。","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":122,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-44a86491fc0a66fb96ed","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-c9cf0497c6ffd682f91e","layer":"original","quote":"绩与奋威将军诸葛融书曰：“昶远来疲困，马无所食；力屈而走，此天助也。今追之力少，可引兵相继；吾欲破之于前，足下乘之于后。岂一人之功哉？宜同断金之义〖11〗！”融答许绩","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":47,"end":130,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-5055a91b8543e00e8439","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-461f3afa77540e474f4b","layer":"original","quote":"以父任为郎〖1〗。后拜建忠都尉〖2〗。叔父才卒，绩领其兵","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":118,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":5,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-999f019c517af186add1","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-82ad66cd927e57683d4e","layer":"original","quote":"年六十八，赤乌十二年卒。权素服举哀，为之感恸。子绩嗣","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-9a21ef299a2b945f66d3","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-461f3afa77540e474f4b","layer":"original","quote":"鲁王霸注意交绩〖5〗，尝至其廨〖6〗，就之坐〖7〗，欲与结好；绩下地住立〖8〗，辞而不当","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":118,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":73,"end":117,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-bc7461d63fc182a20b94","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-fa700e83154fcf39bc45","layer":"original","quote":"建衡二年卒","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":124,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":5,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-c4ac8d93a96d79f5f5f1","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-461f3afa77540e474f4b","layer":"original","quote":"随太常潘璿讨五溪〖3〗，以胆力称","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":118,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":34,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-d14072171647868c3cd3","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-c9cf0497c6ffd682f91e","layer":"original","quote":"初绩与恪、融不平〖13〗，及此事变，为隙益甚","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":192,"end":214,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-d2485065cc8e793b858d","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-2644798b5c13bf211507","layer":"original","quote":"冬，恪、融被害，绩复还乐乡，假节","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":45,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-d46209049517585f74cc","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-f23800be07859b108789","layer":"original","quote":"蜀遣右将军阎宇将兵五千，增白帝守，以须绩之后命","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":121,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":60,"end":83,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-e769518fb7a2643ca585","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-c9cf0497c6ffd682f91e","layer":"original","quote":"然卒，绩袭业，拜平魏将军〖9〗，乐乡督","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-e894d375af904df023f6","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-c9cf0497c6ffd682f91e","layer":"original","quote":"权深嘉绩，盛责怒融。融兄大将军恪贵重，故融得不废","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":167,"end":191,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q2-03b673d9d4d9d7a28b88","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-f23800be07859b108789","layer":"original","quote":"太平二年，拜骠骑将军。孙2 秉政，大臣疑贰〖16〗。绩恐吴必扰乱，而中国乘衅〖17〗；乃密书结蜀，使为并兼之虑〖18〗。蜀遣右将军阎宇将兵五千，增白帝守，以须绩之后命〖19〗。","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":121,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q2-7446c5b07e075e3d5a88","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-2644798b5c13bf211507","layer":"original","quote":"建兴元年，迁镇东将军。二年春〖14〗，恪向新城，要绩并力〖15〗；而留置半州，使融兼其任。冬，恪、融被害，绩复还乐乡，假节。","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q2-d2092ebed8cc3461440f","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-461f3afa77540e474f4b","layer":"original","quote":"绩字公绪。以父任为郎〖1〗。后拜建忠都尉〖2〗。叔父才卒，绩领其兵。随太常潘璿讨五溪〖3〗，以胆力称。迁偏将军，营下督〖4〗，领盗贼事，持法不倾。鲁王霸注意交绩〖5〗，尝至其廨〖6〗，就之坐〖7〗，欲与结好；绩下地住立〖8〗，辞而不当。","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":118,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-ecaf8adc789ce848f183","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-4d4c1542c098dab2b8c8","layer":"original","quote":"孙峻之诛诸葛恪也，壹与全熙、施绩攻恪弟公安督融〖10〗，融自杀","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":72,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
